"description": "Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc. is a biotechnology company, which engages in the discovery, invention, development, manufacture, and commercialization of medicines. Its product portfolio includes the following brands: Dupixent, Evkeeza, Eylea, Inmazeb, and Kevzara. The firm accelerates the traditional drug development process through its proprietary VelociSuite technologies such as VelocImmune. The company was founded on January 8, 1988, and is headquartered in Tarrytown, NY.",
